    <item>
      <title>AstroVault 1.4.5</title>
      <description><![CDATA[
        <h2>Loan &amp; transfer rules</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><b>Transfer-to-account rule action</b> — tag a loan or card payment so it leaves your spending totals and draws down the target account. Or right-click a transaction &rarr; <i>Create Rule from this transaction&hellip;</i></li>
          <li><b>Recategorize existing</b> — an opt-in per-rule toggle to re-tag transactions that already have a category, not just fill blanks.</li>
          <li><b>Loans now count in net worth</b> as liabilities.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>Requires macOS 15+.</p>
      ]]></description>
      <pubDate>Sun, 05 Jul 2026 15:18:47 +0000</pubDate>
